# Azure File Sync – Troubleshooting Guide

This folder documents common Azure File Sync issues encountered during hybrid file server deployments, along with root causes and remediation steps.

All scenarios are aligned with:
- AZ-104 exam objectives
- Real-world enterprise troubleshooting

## Covered Scenarios

1. Port 445 blocked (Azure Files unreachable)
2. Server endpoint unhealthy
3. Files not syncing
4. NTFS / share permission issues
5. Azure File Sync agent service issues
6. File sync conflicts

Each issue includes:
- Symptoms
- Root cause
- Resolution steps
- Validation checks
